<LegalPage
  title="Support — cDot"
  description="Get help with cDot. Visit our help centre, browse common topics, or contact our support team directly."
  heading="cDot support"
>
            <p>If you need help with cDot or want to find out exactly how a feature works under the hood, you can check out our <a href="https://support.certonymity.com/hc/c-email/en" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">help centre here</a>.</p>
    <p><strong>Quick links:</strong></p>
    <ul>
      <li><a href="https://support.certonymity.com/hc/c-email/en/categories/overview" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Overview</a></li>
