    <p>Like most companies, our customer support setup is maintained using a third-party service for capacity and efficiency reasons. In our case, we use Chatwoot, an open-source, self-hosted platform. We do not ask you to reveal sensitive information (such as passwords or private keys) through our support channels. If you'd prefer to get in touch with us directly, please email <a href="mailto:support@certonymity.com">support@certonymity.com</a>.</p>
    <p>We use Mixpanel for product analytics, including tracking events and issues in the cDot app. Actions you take (such as signing up or completing identity verification) will be visible in Mixpanel. This only gives us visibility into generic user events — not to your emails or personal data. We do not use screen captures or screen recordings at any point.</p>
    <p>For more information, please consult our <a href="/privacy-policy/">privacy policy</a> or <a href="/contact/">contact us</a>.</p>
</LegalPage>
